{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/e6272a330b5b03264f42089555e35f0e.avif?t=1748811058\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/e947ed4c87a723e86ff3196758168dd6.avif?t=1748811058\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Team up with up to friends in this online co-op horror game, BACKROOMS INVASION! Fight your way through creepy levels, solving unique puzzles with different mechanics in each. Inspired by the popular creepypasta, the game features iconic monsters and lore-friendly elements.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/f9338ed5ce5dfbfc0b14c9ea2ca68dd3.poster.avif?t=1748811058\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/f9338ed5ce5dfbfc0b14c9ea2ca68dd3.webm?t=1748811058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/f9338ed5ce5dfbfc0b14c9ea2ca68dd3.mp4?t=1748811058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore endless hallways, scavenging for supplies to progress and unlock new zones. But beware, danger lurks around every corner! Learn to identify and avoid the various entities if you want to survive. Gather resources, manage your inventory, and leave no stone unturned. Solve puzzles, unlock hidden areas, and interact with your environment \u2013 every detail might be the key to escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/ad8d28253203582b440bc4de0b45e0d5.poster.avif?t=1748811058\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/ad8d28253203582b440bc4de0b45e0d5.webm?t=1748811058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/ad8d28253203582b440bc4de0b45e0d5.mp4?t=1748811058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BACKROOMS INVASION</strong> is designed to captivate players with its challenging gameplay, unsettling atmosphere, and unique environments. You'll find yourself trapped in a maze of identical rooms, their yellowed walls and worn carpets amplifying the sense of dread. It's clear \u2013 this isn't a place you want to be for long.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2928660?t=1748811058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2928660?t=1748811058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748811058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748811058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD GAME TO WISHLIST!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928660/extras/e6272a330b5b03264f42089555e35f0e.avif?t=1748811058\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\"